#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:2
msgid "Maintenance, Usage, and Updates"
msgstr "维护、用量与更新"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:4
msgid ""
"These Settings pages help you understand, move, and maintain local Studio"
" data."
msgstr "这些设置页面帮助你了解、迁移和维护本地 Studio 数据。"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:8
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "统计"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Settings > Statistics** shows usage for the last 7 days, 30 days, 90 "
"days, or all time. It can include:"
msgstr "**Settings > Statistics** 显示最近 7 天、30 天、90 天或全部时间的用量。它可能包括："

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:13
msgid "number of LLM requests and the success rate;"
msgstr "LLM 请求数量和成功率；"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:14
msgid "total token use and token activity over time;"
msgstr "token 总用量和随时间变化的 token 活动；"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:15
msgid "cache hit rate;"
msgstr "缓存命中率；"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:16
msgid "average request duration and time to first token;"
msgstr "平均请求持续时间和首 token 时间；"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:17
msgid "token share by provider and model."
msgstr "按供应商和模型划分的 token 占比。"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:19
msgid ""
"Use these numbers to compare configurations and notice a sudden increase "
"in cost or latency. They describe recorded runtime usage, not the quality"
" of a response. If the metrics database is unavailable, the page cannot "
"reconstruct the missing data from the conversation alone."
msgstr "使用这些数字比较配置，并注意成本或延迟是否突然增加。它们描述的是记录的运行时用量，而不是回复质量。如果指标数据库不可用，页面无法仅凭对话重建缺失数据。"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:25
msgid "Archived sessions"
msgstr "归档会话"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:27
msgid ""
"Open **Settings > Archived sessions** to search old sessions. Filter by "
"all sessions or sessions without a workspace, then choose **Unarchive** "
"to return one to active use. **Delete** removes an archived session "
"permanently, and **Delete all** removes every session matching the "
"current filter. Use export or another backup before deletion when the "
"history matters."
msgstr "打开 **Settings > Archived sessions** 搜索旧会话。按全部会话或没有工作区的会话筛选，然后选择 **Unarchive** 将会话恢复为活动状态。**Delete** 会永久移除归档会话，**Delete all** 会移除符合当前筛选条件的所有会话。历史记录重要时，删除前请使用导出或其他方式备份。"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:34
msgid "Import session data"
msgstr "导入会话数据"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:36
msgid ""
"The **Import** page accepts a SQLite file exported from Studio's "
"workspace tree. Choose the file, review the import action, and confirm. "
"Studio can restore the session and its available files; a missing "
"external file may not be recoverable from the SQLite file. Review "
"imported prompts and paths before continuing the session in a write-"
"capable mode."
msgstr "**Import** 页面接受从 Studio 工作区树导出的 SQLite 文件。选择文件，审查导入操作，然后确认。Studio 可以恢复会话及其可用文件；缺失的外部文件可能无法从 SQLite 文件中恢复。在可写模式中继续会话前，请审查导入的提示词和路径。"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:43
msgid "About and backend maintenance"
msgstr "About 和后端维护"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Settings > About** shows Studio, backend, protocol, runtime, port, "
"process, log path, package, and license information. Use this page when "
"reporting a problem or checking that the coordinated components are "
"compatible."
msgstr "**Settings > About** 显示 Studio、后端、协议、运行时、端口、进程、日志路径、软件包和许可证信息。报告问题或检查协同组件兼容性时，请使用此页面。"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:49
msgid ""
"You can refresh backend details, restart the backend, repair it, check "
"for updates, update the backend, and open the update history. Repair "
"stops and reinstalls the backend bundled with the current Studio version,"
" so an active model response may be interrupted. Studio defers restart, "
"repair, and update actions while an AI response is running when it can do"
" so safely."
msgstr "你可以刷新后端详情、重启后端、修复后端、检查更新、更新后端并打开更新历史。修复会停止并重新安装当前 Studio 版本随附的后端，因此可能中断正在进行的模型回复。AI 回复运行期间，只要安全可行，Studio 会推迟重启、修复和更新操作。"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:56
msgid "Updates and release notes"
msgstr "更新和发行说明"

#: ../../source/settings/maintenance.rst:58
msgid ""
"Studio may update the client, backend, or both. It can download a "
"differential update and fall back to the full installer if the smaller "
"download fails. A failed automatic update can be retried or completed "
"from the matching GitHub Releases page. Read the changelog after updating"
" so you know which behavior changed."
msgstr "Studio 可以更新客户端、后端或二者。它可以下载差分更新；如果较小的下载失败，则回退到完整安装程序。自动更新失败时，可以重试，或从匹配的 GitHub Releases 页面完成更新。更新后请阅读变更日志，了解哪些行为发生了变化。"
